      "date": "2026-01-18T06:02:54.000Z",
      "title": "First half 2026 earnings released: ₹2.13 loss per share (vs ₹7.30 loss in 1H 2025)",
      "body": "First half 2026 results: ₹2.13 loss per share (improved from ₹7.30 loss in 1H 2025). Revenue: ₹113.2m (down 40% from 1H 2025). Net loss: ₹53.2m (loss narrowed 71% from 1H 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 56 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
