      "date": "2026-01-09T11:16:00.000Z",
      "title": "Cian Healthcare Limited Announces Appointment of Pradeep Kumar Jain, Rajesh Jain, Manish Goswami, and Anjani Misra as Directors, Effective January 9, 2026",
      "body": "Cian Healthcare Limited announced the appointment of Mr. Pradeep Kumar Jain as Promoter and Non-Executive Director, Mr. Rajesh Jain as Promoter and Non-Executive Director, Mr. Manish Goswami as Independent Non-Executive Director, and Mr. Anjani Misra as Independent Non-Executive Director, effective January 9, 2026, as approved by the Implementation Committee in compliance with the NCLT Order dated December 18, 2025. Mr. Pradeep Kumar Jain is a highly esteemed professional in the pharmaceutical industry, boasting over 25 years of experience. His journey began as a pharmaceutical trader in Ukraine and culminated in a leadership role at the Ananta Medicare Group. He holds a bachelor's degree in production management from the National Technical University “Kharkiv Polytechnic Institute,” an MB",
